# nablaDFT's PaiNN (`painn_100k.ckpt`, D286) in stages (D294,
# docs/ml4-ir.md, Section 8): its stages in JAX from SchNetPack's weights,
# checked against SchNetPack's modules and its calculator in float64, then
# exported with 4096 rows a tile and evaluated through the Python model
# (`backend = "STAGES"`) on 8 waters in a cell of 6.2 Å, narrower than
# twice the cutoff, so that the slots hold several images of a particle;
# against SchNetPack's calculator in float64, within ten times ML1's
# tolerances, as the opaque call of model-term-ml4-gpu.test (the virial by
# its trace: the run gives the program's virial). Nothing is fetched here.
#
# REQUIRES: cuda, stages-export, ml4-python, ml4-artifacts
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t/box
# RUN: %ml4_python %S/../../scripts/mlip/painn-stages.py weights %ml4_artifacts/painn_100k.ckpt %t/painn.npz
# RUN: %ml4_python %S/../../scripts/mlip/water-box.py %t/box --n 2 --spacing 3.1 --seed 2 --kind painn --painn-dtype float64 --reference %ml4_artifacts/painn_100k.ckpt --device cpu
# RUN: %jax_python %S/../../scripts/mlip/painn-stages.py check %t/painn.npz %t/box/reference.npz | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=STAGES
# STAGES: stage ctx0 forward
# STAGES: stage readout forward
# STAGES: PASS
# RUN: %jax_python %S/../../scripts/mlip/painn-stages.py export %t/painn.npz %t/model.mlir --rows 4096 --stablehlo-opt %stablehlo_opt --workdir %t
# RUN: %ml4_python %S/../../scripts/mlip/check-model-term.py %t/box %t/model.mlir --backend STAGES --precision Double | %ml4_python %S/Inputs/model-term/compare.py json 10 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %ml4_python %S/../../scripts/mlip/check-model-term.py %t/box %t/model.mlir --backend STAGES --precision Mixed | %ml4_python %S/Inputs/model-term/compare.py json 10 | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: energy ok
# CHECK: forces ok
# CHECK: virial ok
